Hi {Owner},

I build booking sites for appliance repair techs around {City}. {Business Name} has great reviews, but there's no way for someone with a broken fridge or washer to book a slot or send the model number before you arrive.

I built a sample first: online booking by time window, a model sticker finder and upload, the diagnostic fee explained up front and a repair-or-replace page, with marked placeholders where your photos would go:

{demo-link}

If you want it, I move it to a domain you own and finish it for {Build Range}, then {Care Range} a month for hosting and changes. If not, it comes down at the end of the month.

Worth ten minutes this week?

